  "key_features": [
    "On-chip debug-and-trace architecture layered over a JTAG or SWD transport — CoreSight is the architecture, not the wire transport.",
    "Debug Access Port (DAP): a Debug Port (SW-DP / JTAG-DP / SWJ-DP) plus memory-mapping Access Ports (AHB-AP / APB-AP / AXI-AP / JTAG-AP) for memory-mapped access to the debug bus and system memory.",
    "CoreSight debug registers are memory-mapped over a Debug APB; each component occupies a 4 KB register block.",
