  "topology_summary": "Star-of-buses on-chip: an external debugger drives the DAP Debug Port over JTAG/SWD; the DAP's Access Ports master the on-chip debug bus (Debug APB) and system buses (AHB/AXI). Trace flows the other way: many trace sources feed the ATB, funnels merge the ATB streams, replicators fan them to one or more sinks (TPIU off-chip / ETB-ETF on-chip / ETR to DRAM). A CTM channel fabric links the per-component CTIs for cross-triggering.",
